<http://data.silknow.org/image/33983a0d-8fac-3ff5-b81a-efa7465fc725>
        a                  ecrm:E38_Image ;
        dc:identifier      "2019MJ5062" ;
        schema:contentUrl  <https://silknow.org/silknow/media/vam/O316297_3.jpg> , <http://media.vam.ac.uk/media/thira/collection_images/2019MJ/2019MJ5062.jpg> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/65c7635d-37b2-361c-be6c-cfb3d5c2a5c5/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Set of four machine-embroidered dress trimmings.\n\nOne is a flounce of white silk (T.324), machine-embroidered in blue, pink, grey, white, brown and buff silk with an all over design of long-handled baskets of flowers, bows of ribbon, small birds and delicate swags of flowers and leaves. Scalloped lower border embroidered in white and finished off with a tasselled silk fringe.\n\nThe other three are narrow scalloped borders of white silk machine-embroidered to match the flounce with bows of ribbon, birds and floral swags."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/65c7635d-37b2-361c-be6c-cfb3d5c2a5c5> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/65c7635d-37b2-361c-be6c-cfb3d5c2a5c5>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Set of four machine-embroidered dress trimmings.\n\nOne is a flounce of white silk (T.324), machine-embroidered in blue, pink, grey, white, brown and buff silk with an all over design of long-handled baskets of flowers, bows of ribbon, small birds and delicate swags of flowers and leaves. Scalloped lower border embroidered in white and finished off with a tasselled silk fringe.\n\nThe other three are narrow scalloped borders of white silk machine-embroidered to match the flounce with bows of ribbon, birds and floral swags."@en , "Four machine-embroidered silk dress trimmings with silks, England, ca. 1880."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/33983a0d-8fac-3ff5-b81a-efa7465fc725> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/619f3fb9-e98f-3ae1-8b29-25e57c71f45b> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/32d892a7-9b6b-318b-bf6e-fa4a95020373> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/dd189d84-f80f-3967-b5b2-95b74ba030f5> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Four machine-embroidered silk dress trimmings with silks, England, ca. 1880."@en , "Set of four machine-embroidered dress trimmings.\n\nOne is a flounce of white silk (T.324), machine-embroidered in blue, pink, grey, white, brown and buff silk with an all over design of long-handled baskets of flowers, bows of ribbon, small birds and delicate swags of flowers and leaves. Scalloped lower border embroidered in white and finished off with a tasselled silk fringe.\n\nThe other three are narrow scalloped borders of white silk machine-embroidered to match the flounce with bows of ribbon, birds and floral swags."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.324 to C-1965" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O316297> .

